== problem 4: complexity
4.2c per-pixel operation counts (adds/subs/compares, multiplies/divides, exponentials)
kuwahara integral-image cost per pixel: 2 integral images (1 square, 4 adds), 4 sub-windows x (6 adds/subs for the two box sums, 1 sub for the variance, 3 mult/div), 3 compares for the argmin
soft kuwahara adds 4 subs (minus min variance), 4 divides by T, 4 exp, 3 adds (weight sum), 4 mults + 3 adds (weighted mean), 1 divide
